<title>GERMANY: Kolbenschmid says Q1 96/97 pre-tax up.</title>
<headline>Kolbenschmid says Q1 96/97 pre-tax up.</headline>
<dateline>NECKARSULM, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1996/1997 business year ending September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     12.6    vs 9.4</p>
<p>    Group sales				  328     vs 317</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German maker of auto parts is Kolbenschmidt AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
